<title>AUSTRALIA: Motorcycling: Practice times for Australian grand prix.</title>
<headline>Motorcycling: Practice times for Australian grand prix.</headline>
<dateline>EASTERN CREEK 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading 500cc motorcycle practice times in the first official qualifying session on Friday for the Australian Grand Prix on Sunday:</p>
<p> 1. Alex Criville (Spain), Honda,  one minute 30.478 secs</p>
<p> 2. Michael Doohan (Australia), Honda,	   1:30.589s</p>
<p> 3. Luca Cadalora (Italy), Honda,		  1:30.694s</p>
<p> 4. Tadayuki Okada (Japan), Honda,		 1:30.958s</p>
<p> 5. Loris Capirossi (Italy), Yamaha,	     1:31.191s</p>
<p> 6. Kenny Roberts Jnr (U.S.), Yamaha,	    1:31.302s</p>
<p> 7. Norifumi Abe (Japan), Yamaha,		  1:31.419s</p>
<p> 8. Carlos Checa (Spain), Honda,		   1:31.509s</p>
<p> 9. Scott Russell (U.S.), Suzuki,		  1:31.516s</p>
<p> 10. Jean Michel Bayle (France), Yamaha,	 1:31.675s</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
